    "lede": "Voice notes have transformed modern student dating, offering an intimate bridge between sterile text messaging and intimidating phone calls. When deployed with skill, a warm audio message conveys inflection, humor, and confidence that text cannot match. Here is the definitive guide to mastering voice note etiquette on campus.",
