    "kicker": "Date Conversations",
    "h1": "25 First Date Questions That Spark Deep Chemistry (Not Corporate Job Interviews)",
    "lede": "First campus dates frequently derail into stiff interrogations about department courses, credit units, and examination stress. Breaking free from robotic small talk requires asking emotionally evocative, playful, and values-driven questions that unlock genuine laughter and deep chemistry.",
