    "h1": "How to Flirt on WhatsApp Status Without Being Cringe: The College Student Playbook",
    "lede": "WhatsApp Status is the ultimate campus digital billboard. From meme commentary to aesthetic lecture snaps, your 24-hour stories provide subtle opportunities to catch your crush eye. Here is how university students can master the art of charming, dignified status flirting without coming across as desperate or cringe.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
