    "kicker": "Student Safety and Verification",
    "h1": "Why Verified Student Dating Apps Are Safer Than Instagram DMs for Campus Romance",
    "lede": "Sliding into someone Instagram direct messages has become a normalized ritual of modern youth culture, but unvetted social media platforms are riddled with catfishes, financial scammers, and unmonitored harassment. Here is why dedicated, verified student dating platforms provide an exponentially safer and more fulfilling environment for campus romance.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
